      "writtenOn": "2016-10-12T05:06:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you need to add a TCPC-specific function to disable auto-toggle?\n\nThe calls to tcpm_set_cc() below would seem to conflict if the TCPC still controls the CC signals.",
      "revId": "033feede821d785fc0b49dbea6dda4eab3afd974",
