      "writtenOn": "2016-10-12T23:14:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some of this logic appears to be done by the code below the giant switch() statement, though there are a few other conditions. I wonder if you can set pd[port].power_role and then fall thru. That will reduce redundancy in this already monstrous state machine.\n\nOtherwise you can keep this the same and have the outer loop continue before reaching the undesirable portions below.",
