      "writtenOn": "2016-10-12T05:06:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are you sure you\u0027re entering PD_STATE_DRP_AUTO_TOGGLE as expected? I notice that we only enter thru PD_STATE_SRC_DISCONNECTED and PD_STATE_SNK_DISCONNECTED, and only if this bit is not set.",
