      "writtenOn": "2016-10-12T07:22:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "May need to rename the flag. Since PD_STATE_DRP_AUTO_TOGGLE enter from/exit to PD_STATE_SRC/SNK_DISCONNECTED, the flag is to avoid continuous enter and exit if drp_state swap between PD_TOGGLE_ON/OFF/, PD_FORCE_SINK/SOURCE.",
